    "detailed_description": "<h1>Click the banner and join the Community!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become the Super Villain.</strong></h2>Train in the simulation room to master your superpowers and prepare to Conquer Humanity.<br><br>Your superpowers not only include laser eyes but also flying, hyper speed dashes, super strength and a variety of range and melee attacks.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/21d7f0966908a90b44f7c39c2e5de0be.poster.avif?t=1689338573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/21d7f0966908a90b44f7c39c2e5de0be.webm?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/21d7f0966908a90b44f7c39c2e5de0be.mp4?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/1f16611be9e7624dbb0b469ea6ed222a.webp?t=1689338573\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gore, Dismemberments and Destruction.</strong></h2>Master the combat and reach high <strong>Style Ranks</strong> by mixing up attacks and combos.<br><br>You are the strongest thing in the simulation, everything else can be destroyed, exploded or dismembered for those sweet slow motion moments.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/91376ef5375514f1f7a8b959a18e622c.poster.avif?t=1689338573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/91376ef5375514f1f7a8b959a18e622c.webm?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/91376ef5375514f1f7a8b959a18e622c.mp4?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/1f16611be9e7624dbb0b469ea6ed222a.webp?t=1689338573\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple enemies and Bosses.</strong></h2>Don't let your guard down, the simulation is filled with armed enemies and unique bosses.<br><br>Each boss has it's own weak points and tactics, practice their patterns to survive until the end.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/37aa1a0e4110be012e9390253c464cc3.poster.avif?t=1689338573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/37aa1a0e4110be012e9390253c464cc3.webm?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/37aa1a0e4110be012e9390253c464cc3.mp4?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/1f16611be9e7624dbb0b469ea6ed222a.webp?t=1689338573\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WARNING:</strong> You thought you were good at games ? Think twice, this is actually difficult.</h2>If you're skilled, you can win the simulation without getting hit once but misjudging a move or not reacting fast enough can result in you being flatlined and disconnected out of the simulation.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become the Super Villain.</strong></h2>Train in the simulation room to master your superpowers and prepare to Conquer Humanity.<br><br>Your superpowers not only include laser eyes but also flying, hyper speed dashes, super strength and a variety of range and melee attacks.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/21d7f0966908a90b44f7c39c2e5de0be.poster.avif?t=1689338573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/21d7f0966908a90b44f7c39c2e5de0be.webm?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/21d7f0966908a90b44f7c39c2e5de0be.mp4?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/1f16611be9e7624dbb0b469ea6ed222a.webp?t=1689338573\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gore, Dismemberments and Destruction.</strong></h2>Master the combat and reach high <strong>Style Ranks</strong> by mixing up attacks and combos.<br><br>You are the strongest thing in the simulation, everything else can be destroyed, exploded or dismembered for those sweet slow motion moments.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/91376ef5375514f1f7a8b959a18e622c.poster.avif?t=1689338573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/91376ef5375514f1f7a8b959a18e622c.webm?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/91376ef5375514f1f7a8b959a18e622c.mp4?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/1f16611be9e7624dbb0b469ea6ed222a.webp?t=1689338573\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple enemies and Bosses.</strong></h2>Don't let your guard down, the simulation is filled with armed enemies and unique bosses.<br><br>Each boss has it's own weak points and tactics, practice their patterns to survive until the end.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/37aa1a0e4110be012e9390253c464cc3.poster.avif?t=1689338573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/37aa1a0e4110be012e9390253c464cc3.webm?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/37aa1a0e4110be012e9390253c464cc3.mp4?t=1689338573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215060/extras/1f16611be9e7624dbb0b469ea6ed222a.webp?t=1689338573\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WARNING:</strong> You thought you were good at games ? Think twice, this is actually difficult.</h2>If you're skilled, you can win the simulation without getting hit once but misjudging a move or not reacting fast enough can result in you being flatlined and disconnected out of the simulation.",
    "short_description": "Become the super villain in this brutal, top down, fast paced hack and slash where you face ever strengthening forces trying to stop you. Master your abilities in combat, dismember civilians, cause mass destruction, defeat armed enemies and bosses. Conquer Humanity!",
